<title>USA: Mercury General increases dividend.</title>
<headline>Mercury General increases dividend.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mercury General Corp said its board declared a first quarter dividend of $0.29 a share, an annual rate of $1.16, a 20.8 percent increase over the rate paid in 1996.</p>
<p>The increased dividend will be paid on March 31, 1997 to shareholders of record on March 17, 1997.</p>
